WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.691 --> 00:00:03.358
(ambient music)

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:11.200
- [President Duterte] In my country,

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.141
there's three million drug addicts.

00:00:13.141 --> 00:00:16.724
I'd be happy to slaughter
them to finish the problem.

00:00:16.724 --> 00:00:19.712
(tense music)

00:00:19.712 --> 00:00:21.730
- [Female News Anchor] Officers
have repeatedly been accused

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.972
of hunting down and executing people,

00:00:23.972 --> 00:00:25.770
(gun clicks and bangs)

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:27.580
but they insist all the killings

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:29.493
are the result of shootouts.

00:00:30.976 --> 00:00:35.226
(man speaking in Tagalog)

00:00:39.224 --> 00:00:40.069
(gun clicks and bangs)

00:00:40.069 --> 00:00:40.902
(camera shutter clicks)

00:00:40.902 --> 00:00:42.350
(siren wails)

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:43.880
- The Nightcrawlers is a group

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:46.470
of photojournalists
trying to tell this story.

00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:47.597
It's a collective effort.

00:00:47.597 --> 00:00:48.740
(gun clicks and bangs)

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:50.839
(camera shutter clicks)

00:00:50.839 --> 00:00:51.800
- [Male News Anchor]
They hurry to the scene

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:52.950
to get a shot of the body

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:54.938
before the authorities
can clean up the site.

00:00:54.938 --> 00:00:58.188
(gun clicks and bangs)

00:00:59.304 --> 00:01:02.509
(camera shutter clicks)

00:01:02.509 --> 00:01:06.759
(man speaking in Tagalog)

00:01:08.559 --> 00:01:09.890
(woman wailing)

00:01:09.890 --> 00:01:11.963
- She just found out her husband was dead.

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:14.650
- It's so heartbreaking, man.

00:01:14.650 --> 00:01:19.074
(man speaking in Tagalog)

00:01:19.074 --> 00:01:20.510
(gun clicks and bangs)

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:22.160
- Every day, you cover these scenes.

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:23.666
You begin to fear for your life.

00:01:23.666 --> 00:01:26.530
(gun clicks and bangs)

00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:28.330
We will be vigilant.

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:30.078
We will be watching them.

00:01:30.078 --> 00:01:31.303
(gun clicks and bangs)

00:01:31.303 --> 00:01:34.107
(camera shutter clicks)

00:01:34.107 --> 00:01:35.427
(gun bangs)

00:01:35.427 --> 00:01:38.120
We have to actively
challenge what's happening,

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:40.300
because we know it's wrong.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:41.967
We know it's wrong.

00:01:41.967 --> 00:01:45.300
(ominous ambient music)

